          "type": "heading",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "text": "Built by people who carried the pager",
            "level": "h1",
            "size": "h1",
            "eyebrow": "About"
          },
          "column": 1,
          "variant": "plain"
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_wbjp92rntp",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "We spent a decade on call at startups and big companies alike, and the tools always felt built for someone else: enterprise dashboards, per-alert pricing and setup projects that took a quarter. Small teams just needed the right person woken up and a calm way to fix things together."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "We started Tidewire in 2023 to build that tool. Today we're 18 people across nine time zones, profitable, and we still take turns on call for our own product every week."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "column": 1,
          "variant": "default"
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_fdavwhah8t",
          "type": "button",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "label": "We're hiring",
